# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version if you use pyenv:
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different platforms or python versions,
#   this may cause dependency resolution issues.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   According to poetry documentation, poetry.lock should be committed to version control.
#   https://python-poetry.org/docs/basic-usage/#commit-your-poetrylock-file-to-version-control
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   https://pdm.fming.dev/latest/usage/project/#commit-the-lockfile-to-version-control
